\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs28\chcbpat17 202v\endash 213v}}\plain \f1\fs28  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs28\chcbpat17 Kurze theologische Texte}}\plain \f1\fs28  (Auswahl): De confidentia erga pusillanimitatem; Bernardus Claraevallensis: Sermones super Cantica canticorum. Exzerpt aus Sermo 54, beginnend Ed. Leclercq-Rochais 2, 107 Z. 22; (206r) De sensu sacrae scripturae. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs28\chcbpat17 Item notandum liber sacre scripture hoc habet speciale quod sub una littera plures sensus continent}}\plain \f1\i\fs28  \plain \f1\fs28 . . .; (206v) Schema De triplici statu: incipientium, proficientium, perfectorum; (207r) De gradibus humilitatis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs28\chcbpat17 \u8250 \'9bHumilitatis duodecim sunt gradus secundum beatum Benedictum\u8249 \'8b Primus est deum propter suam iustitiam semper timere}}\plain \f1\i\fs28 . Humilitas secundum b. Bernhardum est virtus qua homo verissima sua cognicione . . . 2\plain \f1\i\super\fs40 us\plain \f1\i\fs28   est dei voluntatem et non propriam in desideriis implere\plain \f1\fs28  . . . Endet 209v nach dem 5. Gradus. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs28\chcbpat17 Bloomfield}}\plain \f1\fs28  Nr. 4236; (211r) De fide. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs28\chcbpat17 Fides est sperandarum . . . (Hbr 11,1). Tangit primo obiectum vel intuitum obiecti}}\plain \f1\fs28  . . .; (213v) De corde. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs28\chcbpat17 Item omni custodia . . . (Prv 4,23). Humana natura quasi arbor est cuius radix est cor}}\plain \f1\fs28  . . . \endash  Leer 203v\endash  205v, 210r\endash v, 213r.}

