\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 113v\endash 139v}}\plain \f0\fs28  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Orationes variae}}\plain \f0\fs28 . Sammlung von mehr als 30 Gebeten (Auswahl): (113v) \plain \f0\i\fs28 \u8250 \'9bDulcis oratio valde\u8249 \'8b Transfige dulcissime domine Iesu medullas . . . \plain \f0\fs28 Aus dem Stimulus amoris. J. Klapper, Schriften Johanns von Neumarkt 3 (1939) L. II 14 (221 Z. 6\endash 223); (114v) Hymnus de asc.dom. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f0\fs28  2 Nr. 49 Str. 1\endash 4; (115r) \plain \f0\i\fs28 \u8250 \'9bDicas quando te sentis indispositum\u8249 \'8b O dulcissime atque amantissime domine quem nunc desidero devote suscipere . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Haimerl 90 Anm. 537, 126 Anm. 771; (116r) Exzerpte aus Ps.-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f0\fs28 : De interiori domo seu de conscientia aedificanda c. 21. PL 184, 529 f.; (116v) Hymnus de ass. BMV . AH 50 Nr. 241; (117v) De compassione BMV. \plain \f0\i\fs28 Memento obsecro dulcis mater . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Nachweis s. zu Hs I 290, 114v\endash 115v; (118r) \plain \f0\i\fs28 Omnipotens et misericors deus ecce accedo . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, 279; Haimerl 126 Anm. 771; (119r)\plain \f0\i\fs28  \u8250 \'9bOratio beati Ambrosii ante missam\u8249 \'8b Deus misericordie et veritatis . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Auch Basel UB B X 11, 66v; (119v) Ante missam. \plain \f0\i\fs28 Ne irascaris domine deus . . .\plain \f0\fs28  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Haimerl}}\plain \f0\fs28  91 Anm. 537; (120v) \plain \f0\i\fs28 Eya deus meus, misericordia mea . . .\plain \f0\fs28 ; (121v) \plain \f0\i\fs28 Eya nunc oro optime deus . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Haimerl ebd.; (122v) Post missam. \plain \f0\i\fs28 Gracias ago immense maiestati . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Haimerl ebd.; (123v) Ad BMV et omnes sanctos. \plain \f0\i\fs28 Serenissima et inclita mater domini . . . \plain \f0\fs28  Haimerl 106 Anm. 615; (125v) \plain \f0\i\fs28 Concede nobis quesumus domine per sacramentum . . .\plain \f0\fs28  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Bruylants}}\plain \f0\fs28  2, 121; (125v) \plain \f0\i\fs28 Sentiamus domine quaesumus tui perceptione . . . \plain \f0\fs28 Bruylants 2, 1063; (125v)\plain \f0\i\fs28  Omnipotens et misericors deus, per intercessionem . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Auch Hs I 272, 90r; (126r) Ad sacramentum eucharistiae.\plain \f0\i\fs28  Ave sanctissimum corpus dominicum . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Nachweise s. oben zu Hs I 290, 172v-173v; (129r) \plain \f0\i\fs28 \u8250 \'9bOratio beati Augustini\u8249 \'8b Domine Iesu Christe amantissime per foramen dulcissimi lateris tui . . .\plain \f0\fs28 ; (129r) \plain \f0\i\fs28 \u8250 \'9bDic istam orationem dum sepius poteris sequentem\u8249 \'8b Domine Iesu Christe qui pro nobis peccatoribus . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Hs I 290}}\plain \f0\fs28 , 214v; (129v) \plain \f0\i\fs28 Precor te amantissime domine Iesu Christe propter illam eximiam caritatem . . .\plain \f0\fs28  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures}}\plain \f0\fs28  1, 336; Haimerl 80 Anm. 457, 124 Anm. 735; (131r) \plain \f0\i\fs28 O domine Iesu Christe qui voluisti a Iudeis reprobari . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Hs I 316}}\plain \f0\fs28 , 122r; (131v) \plain \f0\i\fs28 Domine Iesu Christe fili dei vivi, precor te per quinque wlnera tua . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Nachweis s. zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Hs I 290}}\plain \f0\fs28 , 163r; (132v) Ad BMV et Joh.ev. \plain \f0\i\fs28 O intemerata . . . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels}}\plain \f0\fs28  488\endash 490; (135r) \plain \f0\i\fs28 \u8250 \'9bPlanctus beate Marie virginis cum sequeretur Christum ad crucem\u8249 \'8b.\plain \f0\fs28  Exzerpt aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Anselmus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f0\fs28 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 De excellentia virginis Mariae}}\plain \f0\fs28  c. 5, entspricht {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs28  159, 566 C Z. 11 \endash  D Z. 3; (136r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Johannes Fiscannensis}}\plain \f0\fs28 : Oratio. Ohne \u220 \'dcberschrift. \plain \f0\i\fs28 Summe sacerdos et vere pontifex . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Die hier vorliegende Fassung entspricht nur entfernt dem Druck Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels 114 \endash 124; Nachweise s. zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Hs I 290}}\plain \f0\fs28 , 150v; (138r) Ante missam. \plain \f0\i\fs28 Ad mensam igitur dulcissimi convivii tui . . .\plain \f0\fs28  Nachweise s. zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[4].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs28\chcbpat17 Hs I 290}}\plain \f0\fs28 , 159r. \endash  140r\endash 142v leer. }

